& \amountSharedFourAccuracy{} [\amountSharedFourAccuracyLow{}, \amountSharedFourAccuracyHigh{}]
& \amountSharedTwoFourChange{} (\amountSharedTwoFourDenominator{}) \\
Amount: middle to long
